{"id":"A2-L077","title":"Irregular verbs 6: see, send, sit, sleep, speak, spend","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U05","focus":"Irregulares 6: see, send, sit, sleep, speak, spend","targets":{"grammar":"Irregulares 6: see, send, sit, sleep, speak, spend","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":["lose"],"pv":[],"expr":["I’m thinking about…"],"words":["gym session","coffee break","lunch meeting","boss’s message","café table","power nap","busy day","email reply","team call","night shift","weekend plan","lunch order","daily report","phone reply","message list","work chat"],"field":"Serviços","genre":"Transcrição de palestra e podcast","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 77 · Irregular verbs 6: see, send, sit, sleep, speak, spend","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Irregulares 6: see, send, sit, sleep, speak, spend.","**Verbos:** lose.","**Expressões:** I’m thinking about….","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**16 palavras novas** (serviços).","**Texto do dia:** transcrição de palestra e podcast."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar o passado de see, send, sit, sleep, speak e spend, e dizer I’m thinking about…"},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["gym session","gym session"],["coffee break","coffee break"],["lunch meeting","lunch meeting"],["boss’s message","boss’s message"],["café table","café table"],["power nap","power nap"],["busy day","busy day"],["email reply","email reply"],["team call","team call"],["night shift","night shift"],["weekend plan","weekend plan"],["lunch order","lunch order"],["daily report","daily report"],["phone reply","phone reply"],["message list","message list"],["work chat","work chat"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A lecture transcript","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Lecture: Telling a Past Day","paras":["“Yesterday I **saw** a friend, **sent** a message, **sat** in a café, **slept** for an hour, **spoke** with my boss and **spent** two hours at the gym.”","Practice these six verbs. Then ask: “What **are you thinking about** doing this weekend?” Answer: “**I’m thinking about** staying home.”"],"kicker":"LECTURE TRANSCRIPT","by":"Prof. Ames","gloss":[["boss","chefe"],["message","mensagem"],["café","café (lugar)"],["weekend","fim de semana"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The speaker saw a friend.","ans":"T","why":"saw a friend."},{"q":"The speaker slept for six hours.","ans":"F","why":"an hour."},{"q":"The speaker spent two hours at the gym.","ans":"T","why":"two hours at the gym."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“boss” = ?","opts":["chefe","bosque","bola"],"ans":0,"why":"boss."},{"q":"“message” = ?","opts":["mensagem","massagem","mensal"],"ans":0,"why":"message."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Irregular verbs 6","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Base","Passado","Particípio"],"rows":[["see","**saw**","**seen**"],["send","**sent**","**sent**"],["sit","**sat**","**sat**"],["sleep","**slept**","**slept**"],["speak","**spoke**","**spoken**"],["spend","**spent**","**spent**"]],"cap":"Irregular verbs 6"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Planos: **I’m thinking about + -ing** (ainda não decidi)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ a friend. (see)","a":"saw","why":"see-saw."},{"s":"She ___ a message. (send)","a":"sent","why":"send-sent."},{"s":"We ___ in a café. (sit)","a":"sat","why":"sit-sat."},{"s":"He ___ two hours. (spend)","a":"spent","why":"spend-spent."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["message","mensagem"],["café","café (lugar)"],["boss","chefe"],["gym","academia"],["nap","cochilo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["did","you","do","What"],"ans":"What did you do","pt":"O que você fez?"},{"words":["weekend","And","this"],"ans":"And this weekend","pt":"E neste fim de semana?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"gym session","pos":"word","pt":"gym session","ex":"sessão de academia","expt":"Gym session."},{"w":"coffee break","pos":"word","pt":"coffee break","ex":"pausa para o café","expt":"Coffee break."},{"w":"lunch meeting","pos":"word","pt":"lunch meeting","ex":"reunião de almoço","expt":"Lunch meeting."},{"w":"boss’s message","pos":"word","pt":"boss’s message","ex":"mensagem do chefe","expt":"Boss’s message."},{"w":"café table","pos":"word","pt":"café table","ex":"mesa de café","expt":"Café table."},{"w":"power nap","pos":"word","pt":"power nap","ex":"cochilo curto","expt":"Power nap."},{"w":"busy day","pos":"word","pt":"busy day","ex":"dia ocupado","expt":"Busy day."},{"w":"email reply","pos":"word","pt":"email reply","ex":"resposta de e-mail","expt":"Email reply."},{"w":"team call","pos":"word","pt":"team call","ex":"chamada de equipe","expt":"Team call."},{"w":"night shift","pos":"word","pt":"night shift","ex":"turno da noite","expt":"Night shift."},{"w":"weekend plan","pos":"word","pt":"weekend plan","ex":"plano de fim de semana","expt":"Weekend plan."},{"w":"lunch order","pos":"word","pt":"lunch order","ex":"pedido de almoço","expt":"Lunch order."},{"w":"daily report","pos":"word","pt":"daily report","ex":"relatório diário","expt":"Daily report."},{"w":"phone reply","pos":"word","pt":"phone reply","ex":"resposta por telefone","expt":"Phone reply."},{"w":"message list","pos":"word","pt":"message list","ex":"lista de mensagens","expt":"Message list."},{"w":"work chat","pos":"word","pt":"work chat","ex":"conversa de trabalho","expt":"Work chat."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I’m thinking about…** — Estou pensando em…","**What did you do?** — O que você fez?","**And this weekend?** — E neste fim de semana?","**I’m thinking about staying home.** — Estou pensando em ficar em casa.","**Could you call me back?** — Pode me ligar de volta?","**I’ll get back to you.** — Retorno para você.","**Could I leave a message?** — Posso deixar um recado?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"lose","pt":"perder","forms":[["I / you / we / they lose","I lose my keys."],["he / she / it loses","She loses her phone."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"After the weekend","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"After the weekend","lines":[["Ana","What did you do?","O que você fez?"],["Leo","I saw a friend and slept a lot.","Vi um amigo e dormi bastante."],["Ana","And this weekend?","E neste fim de semana?"],["Leo","I’m thinking about staying home.","Estou pensando em ficar em casa."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Schwa /ə/","items":[{"label":"Schwa /ə/","note":"Vogais fracas viram /ə/: about, banana, today, the.","words":["about","banana","today","family","another"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you saw, sent and spent last week.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I saw a film. I sent an email. I spent time with family."},{"q":"Say what you are thinking about doing.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I’m thinking about traveling."},{"q":"Say who you spoke with.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I spoke with my boss."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 6 sentences with see, send, sit, sleep, speak, spend.","model":"Yesterday I saw a friend. I sent a message. I sat in a café. I slept for an hour. I spoke with my boss. I spent two hours at the gym.","checklist":["Usei **6 irregulares**","Usei **I’m thinking about**","Sequência clara"],"words":"6 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “message” mean?","opts":["mensagem","café (lugar)","academia"],"ans":0,"why":"**message** = mensagem."},{"q":"What does “café” mean?","opts":["chefe","café (lugar)","cochilo"],"ans":1,"why":"**café** = café (lugar)."},{"q":"What does “boss” mean?","opts":["academia","ligação","chefe"],"ans":2,"why":"**boss** = chefe."},{"q":"What does “gym” mean?","opts":["academia","cochilo","agenda"],"ans":0,"why":"**gym** = academia."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}